<title>USA: Garden Ridge sets holder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Garden Ridge sets holder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garden Ridge Corp said Tuesday that its board of directors has adopted a stockholder rights plan, whereby the rights will become exercisable if a person or group acquires 15 percent or more of the company's common stock or begins a tender or exchange offer which would result in 15 percent ownership.</p>
<p>Garden Ridge said that the plan has not been adopted in response to any specific effort to acquire control of the company.</p>
</text>
